{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261104%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸終審法院<br/>► 1000　首席法官張舉能、常任法官李義、常任法官霍兆剛、常任法官林文瀚、非常任法官楊偉廉爵士<br/>被判辱國旗罪成自閉青年　申終院上訴許可獲批｜終審上訴</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 1000　34庭　法官郭啟安<br/>28歲男子被控謀殺女瑜伽導師｜續審<br/>► 1430　1庭　首席法官潘兆初、上訴庭副庭長朱芬齡、上訴庭法官區慶祥<br/>官校教師反修例期間因FB帖文遭革職　司法覆核勝訴獲撤決定｜宣布決定　</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官朱文瀚<br/>男子涉半山單位內虐待貴婦狗兼無領狗牌｜判刑<br/>無業男涉Telegram發布淫穢影像｜轉介文件<br/>東亞銀行灣仔分行遇劫　美國籍被告涉劫逾3.5萬元｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　5庭　裁判官丘國新<br/>34歲男涉觀塘海濱公園女廁偷拍｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>勞工處前行政文員涉使用虛假醫生證明書獲取病假遭起訴｜答辯</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T01:25:33.170999+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":511,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.988289+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T01:18:36.979763+00:00","content_hash":"5dbbfd33cdcf685f85623797448ae2f45e6a51a7191178c0641bbe32bda99f46","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}